
### 1. Register Gala Apples Inventory
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/inventory
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "storeId": 1,
  "productId": 2,
  "reorderLevel": 30,
  "reorderQuantity": 100
}


### 2. Get Inventory by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/inventory/1


### 3. Get Store Inventory
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/inventory/store/1


### 4. Check Low Stock
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/inventory/store/1/low-stock


### 5. Receive 120 Units
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/inventory/1/quantity
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 120,
  "type": "INCREASE"
}


### 6. Reserve 10 Units
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/inventory/1/reservation
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 10,
  "type": "RESERVE"
}


### 7. Decrease Stock by 20 Units
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/inventory/1/quantity
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 20,
  "type": "DECREASE"
}


### 8. Check Low Stock Again
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/inventory/store/1/low-stock


### 9. Update Reorder Settings
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/inventory/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reorderLevel": 50,
  "reorderQuantity": 150
}


### 10. Release 5 Reserved Units
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/inventory/1/reservation
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 5,
  "type": "RELEASE"
}


### 11. Deactivate Inventory
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/inventory/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "active": false
}


### 12. Reactivate Inventory
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/inventory/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "active": true
}


### 13. Insufficient Stock Test (400)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/inventory/1/quantity
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 500,
  "type": "DECREASE"
}


### 14. Excessive Reservation Test (400)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/inventory/1/reservation
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 500,
  "type": "RESERVE"
}


### 15. Duplicate Inventory Test (409)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/inventory
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "storeId": 1,
  "productId": 2,
  "reorderLevel": 30,
  "reorderQuantity": 100
}


### 16. Inactive Product Test (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/inventory
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "storeId": 1,
  "productId": 1,
  "reorderLevel": 30,
  "reorderQuantity": 100
}


### 17. Inventory Not Found Test (404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/inventory/999999


### 18. Final Inventory Verification
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/inventory/1
